  "body_html": "<h1>Matching Pennies</h1>\n<p>Matching Pennies is the matrix game\n$$\n  \\begin{pmatrix}\n  1 &amp; -1\\\\\n  -1 &amp; 1\n  \\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\nIts pure maxmin is $-1$ and its pure minmax is $1$, so it has no value in pure\nstrategies.  Its mixed extension has value $0$.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Chapter 2, Section 2.2] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>. Matching Pennies matrix and pure duality gap.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
